  "details": "1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Open Settings -> User Interface -> Chatbox\n\n3. Set Local Chatbox Visibility to \"Mine\"\n\n4. Get a remote user to start typing a long sentence\n\n5. See that the typing indicator still shows up, which is NOT expected. <<<\n\n6. Now let them send the message\n\n7. See that the message does not show, which is expected\n\nAt least PC is affected, but I imagine every platform is",
